y failures. Vortex malfunctions. You\u2019ll need to work together, <br>shout orders, and maybe even shower mid-run to stay alive.\u00a0 <br><br><strong>No one survives alone in Space Chaos!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.poster.avif?t=1764078605\" width=105 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.webm?t=1764078605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Tin Can Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/header.jpg?t=1764078605","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2819410/1848385647/16e46f2c478ff93b2909ff829765a2b55b93f3ed/1761038142/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761038793","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2819410/1848385647/16e46f2c478ff93b2909ff829765a2b55b93f3ed/1761038142/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761038793","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2819410/1848385647/16e46f2c478ff93b2909ff829765a2b55b93f3ed/1761038142/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761038793","id":257220421,"name":"TeaserHook","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220421/7af3c05235e0f103023899308f07f39e95ebd966/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761038793"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2819410/1009610125/90627e15d02335c81487aca877137124e1ef2663/1759565995/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759567355","dash_h264":"https:/